{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39269","headline":"送福州王先辈南归 · 韦庄","name":"送福州王先辈南归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豫章城下偶相逢，自说今方遇至公。\n八韵赋吟梁苑雪，六铢衣惹杏园风。\n名标玉籍僊坛上，家寄闽山画障中。\n明日一杯何处别，绿杨烟岸雨蒙蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}